                "img": "https://arxiv.org/html/2610.26765/2610.26765v1/figures/teleop-setup.png",
                "caption": "Figure 4:Human demonstration collection. Gloves record finger articulation\nand wrist trackers record hand motion. Retargeted commands drive the\nsimulated arm–hand system while theoperator observes the scene.",
