        "header": "5Experiments and Analysis",
        "images": [
            {
                "img": "https://arxiv.org/html/2610.26765/2610.26765v1/main-analysis.png",
                "caption": "Figure 5:Core-50 diagnostics. (a) Task-macro success by hand-skill group\nfor eight multi-task checkpoints and GPT-6 (move_eef); ten\ntrials/task for GPT-6 versus 100 for trained checkpoints (one invalid\nHY-Embodied episode). Task groups are listed in\nTable9. (b)–(d) Episodes at the three transitions of\nSection5.3.3, measured for the eight trained checkpoints;\ngrey: transition never reached, orange:\nfailed at it, light blue: failed after it. (b) Mouse moved 8 cm onto its\npad before any click. (c) Both knobs within5∘5^{\\circ}of target at once\n(grey: at most one knob). (d) Laptop display ever at the requested angle,\nand still there at the end.",
                "position": 1760
            }
        ]
